{"id": "3135888", "revid": "5350", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3135888", "title": "Ume\u00e4lvens delta och sl\u00e4tter", "text": "Ume\u00e4lvens delta och sl\u00e4tter este o arie protejat\u0103 (arie de protec\u021bie special\u0103 avifaunistic\u0103 \u2014 SPA) din Suedia \u00eentins\u0103 pe o suprafa\u021b\u0103 de , integral pe uscat.\nLocalizare.\nCentrul sitului Ume\u00e4lvens delta och sl\u00e4tter este situat la coordonatele .\n\u00cenfiin\u021bare.\nSitul Ume\u00e4lvens delta och sl\u00e4tter a fost declarat arie de protec\u021bie special\u0103 avifaunistic\u0103 \u00een pentru a proteja 44 de specii de animale.\nBiodiversitate.\nSituat\u0103 \u00een ecoregiunile boreal\u0103 \u0219i marin\u0103 baltic\u0103, aria protejat\u0103 nu include niciun habitat protejat.\nLa baza desemn\u0103rii sitului se afl\u0103 mai multe specii protejate de p\u0103s\u0103ri (44): minuni\u021ba (\"Aegolius funereus\"), ra\u021b\u0103 pitic\u0103 (\"Anas crecca\"), ra\u021b\u0103 fluier\u0103toare (\"Anas penelope\"), g\u00e2sc\u0103 de sem\u0103n\u0103tur\u0103 (\"Anser fabalis\"), ciuf de c\u00e2mp (\"Asio flammeus\"), coco\u0219ul de mesteac\u0103n (\"Bonasa bonasia\"), \"Branta leucopsis\", fugaci de \u021b\u0103rm (\"Calidris alpina\"), \"Charadrius morinellus\", erete de stuf (\"Circus aeruginosus\"), erete v\u00e2n\u0103t (\"Circus cyaneus\"), cristeiul de c\u00e2mp (\"Crex crex\"), leb\u0103d\u0103 de iarn\u0103 (\"Cygnus cygnus\"), cioc\u0103nitoare neagr\u0103 (\"Dryocopus martius\"), presur\u0103 de gr\u0103din\u0103 (\"Emberiza hortulana\"), \u0219oim de iarn\u0103 (\"Falco columbarius\"), muscar (\"Ficedula parva\"), \"Gallinago media\", cufundar polar (\"Gavia arctica\"), cufundar mic (\"Gavia stellata\"), ciuvic\u0103 (\"Glaucidium passerinum\"), cocor (\"Grus grus\"), sfr\u00e2ncioc ro\u0219iatic (\"Lanius collurio\"), pesc\u0103ru\u0219 mic (\"Larus minutus\"), sitar de mal nordic (\"Limosa lapponica\"), gu\u0219\u0103 albastr\u0103 (\"Luscinia svecica\"), ferestra\u0219 mic (\"Mergus albellus\"), ferestra\u0219ul mare (\"Mergus merganser\"), bufni\u021b\u0103 polar\u0103 (\"Nyctea scandiaca\"), vultur pescar (\"Pandion haliaetus\"), viespar (\"Pernis apivorus\"), notati\u021ba cu ciocul sub\u021bire (\"Phalaropus lobatus\"), b\u0103t\u0103u\u0219 (\"Philomachus pugnax\"), cioc\u0103nitoare de munte (\"Picoides tridactylus\"), cioc\u0103nitoare verzuie (\"Picus canus\"), ploier auriu (\"Pluvialis apricaria\"), corcodel-urechiat (\"Podiceps auritus\"), pesc\u0103ri\u021b\u0103 mare (\"Sterna caspia\"), chir\u0103 de balt\u0103 (\"Sterna hirundo\"), \"Sterna paradisaea\", \"Strix nebulosa\", \"Surnia ulula\", coco\u0219ul de mesteac\u0103n (\"Tetrao tetrix tetrix\"), fluierar de mla\u0219tin\u0103 (\"Tringa glareola\")."}
